OL,3,GNEWSAFreshers urged to get meningitis B
OL,4,Ajab before term
OL,5,
OL,6,FUniversity freshers are being urged to
OL,7,Fget two doses of the meningitis B
OL,8,Fvaccine ahead of the start of term.
OL,10,FNew figures showed meningitis B caused
OL,11,F97% of cases among 15 to 24-year-olds
OL,12,Fin England last year.
OL,14,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,15,Fsaid invasive meningococcal disease
OL,16,F(IMD) could be serious, with 26 deaths
OL,17,Frecorded among the 348 confirmed cases
OL,18,Fbetween July 2025 to June 2026.
OL,20,FIn Kent, two deaths were recorded in
OL,21,Fthe 21 cases among students and young
OL,22,Fpeople in the Canterbury area in March.
